{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["<b>This one will comfort us.</b> He will rest us from the toil of our hands. Until Noah came they had no plowing implement, and he prepared one for them. And the earth would produce thorns and thistles when they sowed wheat, from the curse of the first Adam, and in the days of Noah it rested — and this is יְנַחֲמֵנוּ. And if you do not explain it thus, the sense of the expression does not fit the name, and you would have to read his name מְנַחֵם."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:57:38.960886671Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}